WEBVTT

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.218
[Anda bisa bilang
seseorang sedang berbohong]

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.448
[Anda bisa bilang tak percaya koran]

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.165
[Tapi Anda tidak bisa bilang ...]

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.000
[apa yang baru Anda lihat ...]

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:53.396
[tidak pernah terjadi]

00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:02.000
[Bantu WITNESS memberi kamera pada dunia]